* `recRep_pull`, `gb_pull`, `disk_pull`: the stored array of the pulled records is the pull of
  the stored array by `extA n g` (`g` on the first `n` digits, the rest fixed).
* `gflat_pull_ext`: `gflat` of it is again a pull by `extA n g`.
