section
-- Source module: Solutions.KFV36LayRev
/-!
# KFV §39: running a layout schedule backwards

`runArrR n d ops` applies the primitives of `ops` in reverse order, each by its forward position
map (`pull` by `permIdx o.idx`): it undoes `runArr` (**`runArrR_runArr`**), hence it is the `pull`
by the reverse relabelling (**`runArrR_eq_pull`**). **`runArrR_flatMap_range`**: a schedule given
as a `flatMap` over `range N` runs backwards as an `iterL` loop over the reversed index.
